+# Request accountability
+
+- **Underlying records and available work:** original signed Woodward notes not recovered. A new, separately scoped eight-page Charlotte/SERO EC inspection identifies original media/notes/backup/copy-holder/transfer/clock records; it is not a substitute note set or completed native-data test.
+- **Exact sources:** preserved mirror acquisition URL/date/bytes/SHA; all eight source-page image hashes; physical/internal/footer/item/paragraph pins. No original audio/backup/signature/custody hash fabricated.
+- **Conflicting records and precision:** retain original/copy/work-copy/future roles, signed/unsigned entry types, Sept13snapshot versus Sept11claim, witness/system-time divergence, approximate/precise labels, missing-unit phrase versus later25minutes, and route/no-record uncertainty. No controlling value or cause selected.
+- **Counterevidence and dependence:** reported timer default and negative alternate-recording check included; no complete recording presumed. Eight statement entries and two CD-ROM item labels are not independent witness/call counts. One chain is not independent corroboration.
+- **Our scope assumption:** initial five-page completeness was too broad. It was corrected additively and the actual document end found; three more pages prospectively scoped and read. Final claim is complete eight-page EC only, not attachments or whole compilation.
+- **TODOs and original scope:** all five tracks/18requirements remain open/partial; raw media, notes, actual receipts, effective configurations, clock/route/call joins still needed. No other owner's technical acceptance claimed.
+- **Revision:** additive report, source pins and exact addition diff; prior protocols/reports/evidence/public history unchanged. No PDF creation/layout export; actual source images inspected.
+- **Public payload:** appropriate selected original research/paraphrases/locators only. Raw marked files/images/full text, signatures, contact/personal/financial/private case/correspondence/strategy/access data excluded. No redacted identity reconstructed or unrelated customer/reservation allegation adopted.
+- **Publication:** separate actual AveLyra account/repository/SSH/author/committer/ref/all-file receipts required. This prepublication checklist does not assert push/main merge/independent acceptance/Overview delivery.
+- **Restrictions:** no new original request/contact/fee/filing, experiment, personal mailbox/private case, source overwrite/deletion, private push or history rewrite. No cross-chat transmission; earlier approval boundary retained.
